| **MNE cross-tool corroboration** | (commit 2e69d896a) MNE pipeline에서 동일 60s resting 재분석 → cross-tool ICA 일관성 verify | 0.5-1주 | own#2 (b)-sub-axis robustness evidence (cross-tool methodology validation) |
